  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your fearsome leadership drives your underlings to push harder for success.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Taskmaster<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use this feat as a swift or move action, and you can affect an ally whose Hit Dice (and mythic rank or tier, if any) do not exceed your Hit Dice plus your mythic tier. If you use this ability as a standard action, your ally gains a +2 morale bonus on attack rolls, weapon damage rolls, and Will saves against mind-affecting effects. You can expend one use of mythic power to negate the ─2 penalty to AC and on skill checks caused by this feat. Alternatively, you may retain the penalty but extend the duration of the effect by a number of minutes equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc114\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
